993
01:02:11,003 --> 01:02:13,927
Ingekuwa bora zaidi tungekuwa na wazo jipya kabisa.

994
01:02:13,967 --> 01:02:16,493
Kisha unafanya hivyo!

995
01:02:16,533 --> 01:02:18,733
Siwezi kukusaidia.

996
01:02:20,233 --> 01:02:24,313
Sawa, wewe...rudi nyuma.

997
01:02:24,353 --> 01:02:26,533
Kwa nini ulikuwa bado umeamka usiku kucha?

998
01:02:27,793 --> 01:02:30,023
Ulikuwa unanitumia ujumbe baada ya saa tatu.

999
01:02:32,867 --> 01:02:34,667
Ninalala saa 7 au 8 asubuhi

1000
01:02:35,867 --> 01:02:37,867
Sikulala kabisa usiku huo.

1001
01:02:39,033 --> 01:02:40,260
Ndiyo. Sijawahi kulala vizuri.

1002
01:02:40,300 --> 01:02:42,200
Kwa nini unalala saa saba au nane?

1003
01:02:42,500 --> 01:02:44,393
Unahariri, au nini?

1004
01:02:44,433 --> 01:02:46,527
Ndiyo. Wasiwasi. Nina wasiwasi.

1005
01:02:46,567 --> 01:02:47,393
Una wasiwasi?

1006
01:02:47,433 --> 01:02:48,727
Ndiyo.

1007
01:02:48,767 --> 01:02:50,427
Unapaswa kuzungumza nami kuhusu hili.

1008
01:02:56,067 --> 01:02:58,760
- Labda siku moja... - Ninateseka sana.

1009
01:02:58,800 --> 01:03:01,660
Siku moja, [sielewi] ... Nitakurekodi usiku kucha.

1010
01:03:01,700 --> 01:03:05,260
[haijulikani]

1011
01:03:05,300 --> 01:03:08,327
Ningependa hilo.

1012
01:03:08,367 --> 01:03:10,260
Ndiyo. Nilitapika damu usiku kucha.

1013
01:03:10,300 --> 01:03:12,490
Ulipaswa kunipigia simu. Huyo ndiye wewe halisi.

1014
01:03:14,800 --> 01:03:16,760
Ah!

1015
01:03:16,800 --> 01:03:20,400
Au jirekodi mwenyewe, badala ya kupiga picha tu.

1016
01:03:24,567 --> 01:03:25,417
Mbona. Niliendelea...

1017
01:03:25,457 --> 01:03:26,897
Kutapika damu. Hongera!

1018
01:03:26,937 --> 01:03:28,007
Kwa nini unanisukuma?

1019
01:03:29,533 --> 01:03:33,853
Hapana, sioni jinsi wasiwasi wako unavyoonekana.

1020
01:03:33,893 --> 01:03:35,263
Nina hamu ya kujua.

1021
01:03:35,633 --> 01:03:37,843
Bado hii haionyeshi?

1022
01:03:37,883 --> 01:03:39,263
Ninapaswa kuwa na wasiwasi kiasi gani?

1023
01:03:41,623 --> 01:03:42,793
Na bado haionekani?

1024
01:03:42,833 --> 01:03:47,337
Unaonekana umetulia sana, hata kama una wasiwasi kiasi hiki.

1025
01:03:49,067 --> 01:03:49,917
Ndiyo.

1026
01:03:53,967 --> 01:03:56,527
Kwa hivyo, je, una wasiwasi [bila shaka]?

1027
01:03:57,067 --> 01:03:58,707
Nini?

1028
01:03:58,747 --> 01:03:59,693
Wasiwasi!

1029
01:03:59,733 --> 01:04:01,173
Je, Mungu wako ana wasiwasi?

1030
01:04:01,700 --> 01:04:03,490
Bila shaka Mungu hana wasiwasi.

1031
01:04:05,100 --> 01:04:09,290
Mungu hana wasiwasi? Hawezi hata kukukabili.

1032
01:04:10,533 --> 01:04:12,543
Nataka tu kuwa vizuri.

1033
01:04:21,267 --> 01:04:23,707
Lakini wewe ni mzuri katika kusubiri.

1034
01:04:23,747 --> 01:04:24,987
Una subira.

1035
01:04:27,227 --> 01:04:32,160
Unasubiri kwa subira waigizaji wako wajibu.

1036
01:04:32,200 --> 01:04:32,893
Ndiyo.

1037
01:04:32,933 --> 01:04:35,913
Ilikuwa vivyo hivyo kwenye sarakasi.

1038
01:04:35,953 --> 01:04:36,910
Uliendelea kusubiri tu.

1039
01:04:38,033 --> 01:04:42,808
Bila shaka. Nawapenda sana nyote.

1040
01:04:43,033 --> 01:04:44,227
Loo, jamani!

1041
01:04:44,267 --> 01:04:48,487
Namaanisha, ulipenda sana kurekodi filamu [haijulikani] na [haijulikani].

1042
01:04:49,187 --> 01:04:53,407
Uliwafuata siku nzima, bila kusema neno,

1043
01:04:53,447 --> 01:04:55,367
na kuendelea kuzirekodi,

1044
01:04:55,407 --> 01:05:01,867
kuwaona wakipotea

1045
01:05:01,907 --> 01:05:02,157
kwa...

1046
01:05:02,197 --> 01:05:07,967
mwisho wa ajabu, bila kukosa subira.

1047
01:05:09,800 --> 01:05:12,930
Hapana, sina subira.

1048
01:05:12,970 --> 01:05:15,827
Kila sekunde huhisi sawa.

1049
01:05:15,867 --> 01:05:18,257
Unaishi kweli katika wakati huu.

1050
01:05:19,600 --> 01:05:22,100
Ndiyo. Kama ilivyo sasa hivi.

1051
01:05:24,633 --> 01:05:26,513
Hilo ni jambo la kushangaza sana.

1052
01:05:27,733 --> 01:05:30,863
Nimefikiria kupiga picha.

1053
01:05:30,903 --> 01:05:35,873
Nyinyi wawili mmelala kitandani, na...

1054
01:05:36,713 --> 01:05:43,333
[Haijulikani] inaweza kuwa...

1055
01:05:43,373 --> 01:05:50,373
uchi kabisa,

1056
01:05:50,753 --> 01:05:52,953
lakini mgongo wako umegeuzwa,

1057
01:05:52,993 --> 01:05:59,453
na wazo langu la kwanza kabisa lilikuwa kukukuta

1058
01:05:59,493 --> 01:06:00,343
kama hii,

1059
01:06:00,573 --> 01:06:02,653
huku umemgeukia mgongo,

1060
01:06:02,693 --> 01:06:05,053
amevaa kikamilifu,

1061
01:06:05,093 --> 01:06:11,553
kusema mambo kama yale uliyosema.

1062
01:06:11,593 --> 01:06:12,663
Hilo lilikuwa wazo langu.

1063
01:06:13,033 --> 01:06:14,193
Ni picha ya kawaida sana.

1064
01:06:14,233 --> 01:06:18,643
Ni kweli. Siwezi kufikiria chochote kilichosafishwa.

1065
01:06:19,300 --> 01:06:22,640
Hapana, simaanishi kinyume cha "iliyosafishwa."

1066
01:06:22,900 --> 01:06:24,900
Kisha kinyume cha nini?

1067
01:06:27,133 --> 01:06:28,593
Clichéd dhidi ya safi.

1068
01:06:29,567 --> 01:06:31,787
Mbichi? Mbichi ya aina gani?

1069
01:06:31,827 --> 01:06:34,753
Haijasasishwa. Imebadilishwa kwa maneno dhidi ya mpya.

1070
01:06:34,793 --> 01:06:37,650
Nini? Sikupaswa kuja. Sikupaswa kuchukua hatua.

1071
01:06:38,467 --> 01:06:39,560
Mbona, nini?

1072
01:06:39,600 --> 01:06:41,900
Sikuwahi kuwa ndani yake, tangu mwanzo.

1073
01:06:45,060 --> 01:06:47,520
Tarehe 26—jamani—ninazima simu yangu.

1074
01:06:48,267 --> 01:06:49,887
Je, unajuta?

1075
01:06:50,200 --> 01:06:52,870
Ndiyo na hapana. Nadhani tu...

1076
01:06:55,540 --> 01:06:56,630
Ee Mungu!

1077
01:06:56,670 --> 01:07:00,100
Mazungumzo haya yote ya kipuuzi, na bado tunaigiza upuuzi huu wa kipuuzi...

1078
01:07:02,860 --> 01:07:05,070
Ni bora nitoweke tu tarehe 26.

1079
01:07:08,633 --> 01:07:11,293
Je, una wasiwasi?

1080
01:07:11,333 --> 01:07:12,793
Kisha tufanye nini?

1081
01:07:12,833 --> 01:07:13,593
Hasa.

1082
01:07:13,633 --> 01:07:15,233
Huwezi kuwalazimisha watu.

1083
01:07:16,100 --> 01:07:18,793
Sawa. Tayari ni kiti tupu.

1084
01:07:18,833 --> 01:07:19,560
Huh?

1085
01:07:19,600 --> 01:07:21,420
Kiti kitupu.

1086
01:07:28,667 --> 01:07:31,427
Bata. Jiandae. Tarehe 26, nani anajua

1087
01:07:31,467 --> 01:07:32,867
nini kitatokea.

1088
01:07:33,667 --> 01:07:36,487
Sitaki kusukuma, [haijulikani].

1089
01:07:36,587 --> 01:07:39,087
Sitakusukuma. Nitakusubiri.

1090
01:07:39,133 --> 01:07:46,133
Kuelekea nyumbani. Nini?

1091
01:07:54,073 --> 01:07:56,593
Kuna nini?

1092
01:07:56,633 --> 01:07:59,260
Nini?

1093
01:07:59,300 --> 01:08:00,493
Subiri, kwa umakini?

1094
01:08:00,533 --> 01:08:02,153
Kwa uzito.

1095
01:08:13,143 --> 01:08:16,193
Kwaheri. Kwaheri.

1096
01:08:16,233 --> 01:08:17,060
Nini?

1097
01:08:17,100 --> 01:08:18,760
Mbona!

1098
01:08:18,800 --> 01:08:24,460
Subiri, hujanirudishia maikrofoni yangu ya lav. La!

1099
01:08:24,500 --> 01:08:30,970
Loo! Unafanya nini?

1100
01:08:31,010 --> 01:08:32,900
hapa?

1101
01:08:33,267 --> 01:08:34,877
Ulisema nini [haijulikani]?

1102
01:08:36,000 --> 01:08:37,527
Mfanye arudi.

1103
01:08:37,567 --> 01:08:38,817
Nenda umwambie nilisema mimi

1104
01:08:38,857 --> 01:08:40,427
sitaelewa hili. [unclear]

1105
01:08:40,467 --> 01:08:42,427
Tafadhali, nakuomba!

1106
01:08:42,467 --> 01:08:45,060
Huwezi kukabili hilo, kwa hivyo unanilazimisha nifanye hivyo?

1107
01:08:45,100 --> 01:08:46,493
Nenda, nenda, nenda!

1108
01:08:46,533 --> 01:08:48,173
Nitaenda kupumzika.

1109
01:08:48,667 --> 01:08:50,837
Mbona. Haiaminiki!

1110
01:08:50,877 --> 01:08:52,327
Haraka! Mpigie simu tena!

1111
01:08:52,367 --> 01:08:53,727
Siendi. Fanya mwenyewe.

1112
01:08:53,767 --> 01:08:54,997
Nilisema sitakisukuma.

1113
01:08:55,037 --> 01:09:00,093
Kama unataka tu kututazama tukiigiza haya yote...

1114
01:09:00,133 --> 01:09:00,533
Nini?

1115
01:09:00,573 --> 01:09:03,473
Hilo sio tukio ninalotaka kuona.

1116
01:09:03,513 --> 01:09:04,360
Tukio la mwisho.

1117
01:09:04,400 --> 01:09:04,820
Ndiyo.

1118
01:09:04,860 --> 01:09:05,470
Asante.

1119
01:09:05,510 --> 01:09:08,060
Lakini ulipotuomba tujichezee wenyewe—- sikuuliza

1120
01:09:08,100 --> 01:09:09,193
nyinyi kucheza wenyewe.

1121
01:09:09,233 --> 01:09:13,073
Weka hivyo.

1122
01:09:21,100 --> 01:09:23,920
Kwa sababu tukio hili la mwisho

1123
01:09:23,960 --> 01:09:25,193
ni ndoto tu.

1124
01:09:25,233 --> 01:09:26,583
Ndoto hiyo ni...

1125
01:09:27,053 --> 01:09:29,023
Lazima

1126
01:09:30,100 --> 01:09:33,390
Jipoteze kabisa. Kabisa.

1127
01:09:33,833 --> 01:09:34,683
Ndiyo.

1128
01:09:34,733 --> 01:09:37,413
Kwa nini msijaribu kuishikilia hivi kwanza?

1129
01:09:37,973 --> 01:09:38,823
Ndiyo.

1130
01:09:40,967 --> 01:09:41,827
Cheza kidogo.

1131
01:09:42,407 --> 01:09:43,207
Pata hisia ya hilo.

1132
01:09:43,247 --> 01:09:44,097
Ndiyo.

1133
01:09:45,067 --> 01:09:46,907
Hatua za densi zinaweza kufanya kazi pia.

1134
01:09:47,000 --> 01:09:48,650
Sawa, kama wewe...

1135
01:09:48,967 --> 01:09:51,977
Kama densi hiyo katika Joker.

1136
01:09:52,457 --> 01:09:54,137
Kidogo karibu na bafuni.

1137
01:09:54,933 --> 01:09:55,560
Ndiyo.

1138
01:09:55,600 --> 01:09:57,920
Usiinakili. Huna haja ya kuiga.

1139
01:09:57,960 --> 01:10:02,070
Hisia hiyo tu ya kupumzika kabisa.

1140
01:10:02,280 --> 01:10:04,320
Ukiwa mtulivu iwezekanavyo.

1141
01:10:04,533 --> 01:10:05,533
Nahitaji kupumzika kidogo.

1142
01:10:06,103 --> 01:10:07,263
Sawa. Nimepumzika kabisa.

1143
01:10:23,583 --> 01:10:26,880
Hisia hiyo ya miili yenu ikiungana.

1144
01:10:27,700 --> 01:10:30,640
Kuungana katika...

1145
01:10:33,133 --> 01:10:35,993
Pumzika. Nyote wawili mnahitaji kupumzika, au

1146
01:10:36,033 --> 01:10:37,560
Hutapata athari hiyo.

1147
01:10:37,600 --> 01:10:38,470
Mafunzo ya kupumzika.

1148
01:10:39,133 --> 01:10:42,223
Je, mmejaribu uboreshaji wa mawasiliano?

1149
01:10:43,133 --> 01:10:43,983
Wasiliana na uboreshaji.

1150
01:10:44,813 --> 01:10:46,923
Watu wawili wanawasiliana

1151
01:10:46,973 --> 01:10:50,583
na kupata pointi za usaidizi kati yao.

1152
01:10:50,853 --> 01:10:51,773
Loo, densi [isiyoeleweka].

1153
01:10:51,813 --> 01:10:52,663
Mm-hmm.

1154
01:10:53,133 --> 01:10:54,053
Tunaweza kujaribu.

1155
01:10:54,533 --> 01:10:54,927
Kuna nini?

1156
01:10:54,967 --> 01:10:57,367
Ni kama kucheza karibu na sehemu ya kugusana.

1157
01:10:57,467 --> 01:10:58,647
Ndiyo, haswa.

1158
01:10:59,007 --> 01:11:01,557
Kama tai chi, lakini wewe...

1159
01:11:01,597 --> 01:11:03,457
Sio shindano. Mnasaidiana.

1160
01:11:03,497 --> 01:11:04,447
Na kisha...

1161
01:11:04,800 --> 01:11:09,160
Sawa. Mpe mwili wako mtu mwingine.

1162
01:11:09,867 --> 01:11:15,127
Msisukumane.

1163
01:11:15,167 --> 01:11:19,487
Tumia nguvu za kila mmoja. Saidianeni.

1164
01:11:19,600 --> 01:11:22,800
Uh, sivyo kwa [haijulikani] ... kwamba ...

1165
01:11:23,300 --> 01:11:24,150
Nyinyi wawili jaribuni.

1166
01:11:24,600 --> 01:11:25,450
Tu...

1167
01:11:25,840 --> 01:11:28,040
Anza na kitu rahisi...

1168
01:11:28,400 --> 01:11:29,710
Sawa, ndivyo ilivyo.

1169
01:11:30,633 --> 01:11:31,483
Hakika.

1170
01:11:47,743 --> 01:11:50,427
Subiri, tufanye nini na kamera?

1171
01:11:50,567 --> 01:11:51,767
Ameng anashikilia tena.

1172
01:11:52,200 --> 01:11:53,640
Nitaishika na kumfuata Jiarui.

1173
01:11:54,633 --> 01:11:56,953
Na unahitaji kuwa na furaha kweli.

1174
01:11:57,600 --> 01:11:58,855
Furaha kweli.

1175
01:11:58,895 --> 01:12:01,870
Unamaanisha nini, "furaha kweli"?

1176
01:12:02,050 --> 01:12:02,900
Ni...

1177
01:12:04,233 --> 01:12:05,393
Ni tu...

1178
01:12:07,767 --> 01:12:11,207
Hisia kwamba kitu hiki kimeunganishwa nawe.

1179
01:12:12,533 --> 01:12:14,103
Nitajaribu.

1180
01:12:14,503 --> 01:12:15,423
Sawa.

1181
01:12:17,633 --> 01:12:19,093
Ukichoka, tutapumzika.

1182
01:12:19,133 --> 01:12:19,833
Hatujachoka.

1183
01:12:19,873 --> 01:12:20,723
Sio uchovu.

1184
01:12:21,733 --> 01:12:22,583
Njoo.

1185
01:12:26,633 --> 01:12:30,653
Mwezi unaonekana mzuri usiku wa leo. Unataka kutembea?

1186
01:12:31,253 --> 01:12:32,103
Mm.

1187
01:12:32,143 --> 01:12:33,463
Unataka kutembea nami?

1188
01:12:34,867 --> 01:12:35,717
Mm.

1189
01:12:38,667 --> 01:12:41,067
Imekuwa muda mrefu tangu tuende kutembea.

1190
01:12:48,200 --> 01:12:49,050
Mm.

1191
01:12:56,833 --> 01:12:57,683
Nenda...

1192
01:13:00,833 --> 01:13:01,683
Nge.

1193
01:13:09,733 --> 01:13:11,342
Endelea. Nitakuwa sawa peke yangu.

1194
01:13:35,300 --> 01:13:36,150
Upo hapo?

1195
01:13:42,567 --> 01:13:43,417
Niko hapa.

1196
01:13:57,767 --> 01:13:58,687
Je, una huzuni?

1197
01:14:04,733 --> 01:14:06,093
Lazima unaumia.

1198
01:14:11,167 --> 01:14:12,527
Acha niwe na huzuni kwa ajili yako.

1199
01:14:27,833 --> 01:14:28,833
Unanipenda?

1200
01:14:30,100 --> 01:14:31,100
Sema unanipenda.

1201
01:14:31,980 --> 01:14:33,020
Nakupenda.

1202
01:14:48,933 --> 01:14:50,093
Je, utakuwa hapa kila wakati?

1203
01:14:53,233 --> 01:14:54,277
Je, utakuwa hapa kila wakati?

1204
01:14:58,333 --> 01:14:59,377
Je, utakuwa hapa kila wakati?

1205
01:15:08,233 --> 01:15:09,083
Mwezi.

1206
01:15:10,767 --> 01:15:13,227
Nataka mwezi.

1207
01:15:21,967 --> 01:15:23,937
Inaendelea kuwa kubwa zaidi, na kisha...

1208
01:15:25,600 --> 01:15:26,450
Kubwa zaidi.

1209
01:15:29,333 --> 01:15:30,573
Inakua kubwa sana.

1210
01:15:34,133 --> 01:15:36,843
Kubwa sana na nyepesi sana, na kisha

1211
01:15:38,500 --> 01:15:42,100
Inaelea mbali sana.

1212
01:15:46,833 --> 01:15:47,793
Tembea kuelekea huko.

1213
01:15:53,433 --> 01:15:54,283
Kamba.

1214
01:15:55,567 --> 01:15:56,417
Na mvuto.

1215
01:16:02,367 --> 01:16:03,217
Hesabu...

1216
01:16:05,600 --> 01:16:06,840
Ninacheza ndani ya maji.

1217
01:16:13,633 --> 01:16:14,513
Muda mrefu sana.

1218
01:16:31,000 --> 01:16:31,850
Ninachora.

1219
01:16:32,360 --> 01:16:33,720
Ninaichora, na kisha...

1220
01:16:36,400 --> 01:16:37,440
Kuna giza pale.

1221
01:16:40,367 --> 01:16:41,507
Ni angavu pale.

1222
01:16:45,167 --> 01:16:46,047
Rangi zote

1223
01:16:47,267 --> 01:16:48,147
wako juu yake.

1224
01:17:03,133 --> 01:17:04,453
Kuja kwangu.

1225
01:17:10,600 --> 01:17:11,450
Hapana.

1226
01:17:34,933 --> 01:17:36,163
Niangalie. Mm.

1227
01:17:45,533 --> 01:17:46,813
Mm. Mm-hmm.

1228
01:17:47,173 --> 01:17:48,023
Tsk.

1229
01:17:48,933 --> 01:17:50,173
Bado unaweza kunihisi?

1230
01:17:50,533 --> 01:17:51,383
Mh?

1231
01:17:51,433 --> 01:17:52,603
Mm-hmm.

1232
01:18:03,367 --> 01:18:04,447
Katika macho yako,

1233
01:18:06,633 --> 01:18:08,073
Siwezi kusoma chochote.

1234
01:18:11,400 --> 01:18:12,400
Nimetoweka.

1235
01:18:25,333 --> 01:18:26,413
